# Terminfo entry for the Dotty terminal emulator.
#
# Compile with ncurses tic (extended capabilities need -x):
#   tic -x -o <dir> terminfo/xterm-dotty.src
# and check the result with:
#   infocmp -x -A <dir> xterm-dotty
#
# The entry is xterm-256color plus the capabilities below. Each one is
# implemented by Dotty, answered by XTGETTCAP with the same value, and run
# through Dotty by TerminfoCapabilityTests (tests/Dotty.App.Tests), which also
# fails when this file and Dotty.Terminal.Adapter.TerminfoCapabilities differ.
# Styled underlines (Smulx, Setulc) are not advertised until they are drawn.
xterm-dotty|dotty|Dotty terminal emulator,
	Tc,
	Ss=\E[%p1%d q,
	Se=\E[2 q,
	Sync=\E[?2026%?%p1%{1}%=%th%el%;,
	BE=\E[?2004h,
	BD=\E[?2004l,
	PS=\E[200~,
	PE=\E[201~,
	use=xterm-256color,
